  "steps": [
    "Whisk the besan with 2 cups of water into a smooth batter with no lumps.",
    "Heat the oil in a pan, crackle the mustard seeds and cumin seeds, then add hing and curry leaves.",
    "Add the garlic, green chilli and onion and cook until the onion is soft and golden.",
    "Stir in turmeric, chilli powder and salt.",
    "Lower the heat and pour in the besan batter while stirring continuously.",
    "Cook for 6-8 minutes, stirring, until thick and no raw smell remains; cover and steam for 2 minutes.",
    "Garnish with coriander leaves and serve hot with bhakri or roti."
  ]
